Route macOS arm64 clients to the recipe's floating-point environment header.

Source: Libm-2026 (17a5f9daa3f5679f7536b26f133b40cc078753c3), Source/fenv.h.
Scope: macOS SDK 26.0 and 26.5, arm64.

The upstream 32-bit ARM header describes FPSCR. The arm64 implementation
uses separate FPSR and FPCR registers. recipes/libm/arm64_fenv.h records the
C interface, XNU register definitions and verification against libSystem.

Evidence: tests/installed_headers/fenv_abi.c and
tests/installed_headers/check_fenv_runtime.py.

--- a/usr/include/fenv.h
+++ b/usr/include/fenv.h
@@ -26,6 +26,8 @@
 #include "architecture/ppc/fenv.h"
 #elif (defined (__i386__) || defined( __x86_64__ ))
 #include "architecture/i386/fenv.h"
+#elif defined(__arm64__)
+#include "architecture/arm64/fenv.h"
 #elif defined(__arm__)
 #include "architecture/arm/fenv.h"
 #else
